# The template itself does not compile: nothing to ignore on the Unity side.
# What follows only concerns instantiation trials made on the spot.

# Paths specific to this machine (games folder, Unity, Python), remembered by tools/new-game.ps1.
# Versioning them would impose one workstation's layout on all the others.
local.settings.json

*.log
__pycache__/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# WARNING: NEVER add *.meta here.
# skeleton/Assets/Settings/*.meta carry the GUIDs of the URP assets. Losing them breaks the render
# pipeline of every project generated afterwards.
